   "e": "0zzxtuzvswyvtxyn0ozxeuywxxvu0yxxvwwuvh00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/out-west/clips/0000293771-0000300945.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "dur": 7.17,
     "src": "Out West",
     "y": 1918,
     "q": "a man in a dark suit standing in the desert",
     "fit": 0.364
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/57a0dfaf-8a5f-5813-b47f-97264eff361b/v3-ffmpeg-openclip-1/clips/1f3282cf-e0c5-5141-a47a-682b0141b785.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "dur": 6.61,
     "src": "KEEP THIS UNDER YOUR HOOD, ca. 1940",
     "y": null,
     "q": "a pair of scissors cutting paper",
     "fit": 0.313
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "THE REGENT"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "THE REGENT",
   "text": "You have exceeded your daily allotment of meaning.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep16/v08.wav",
   "d": 3.525,
   "e": "000yzwnpvztuhrxnyywvuxz8rpopyzwnh7000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "THE SHEPHERD",
   "text": "Is meaning private property?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep16/v09.wav",
   "d": 2.475,
   "e": "000oytnnsvwurki1000axzzmx40kzw0tenl80000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "THE REGENT",
   "text": "Meaning is communal. And therefore regulated. Even I hate this.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep16/v10.wav",
   "d": 4.575,
   "e": "00uzyurpzysm0uwzlxxwvvorh0xxwrxnlli00000"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "you can't say anything anymore these days",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/day-of-thanksgiving-a/clips/0000318451-0000342809.mp4",
   "in": 10.9,
   "d": 5.35,
   "said": "And then, well, we all knew it, there are some things you just can't say.",
   "src": "Day of Thanksgiving, A",
   "y": 1951
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "WHISPER",
   "text": "Say something true. Say something punishable.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep16/v12.wav",
   "d": 3.225,
   "e": "000lzylztzvnvzwuodjzwyqvpsyvppxtc0000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "THE PODCASTER",
   "text": "Okay. Watch this. I am pro—",
   "wav": "pilot/ep16/v13.wav",
   "d": 2.675,
   "e": "000jwazzztwzxgmemgpclstto4nxule600000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "A bar slams across his chest and pins him flat to the sand.",
   "see": [
    "a man lying face down in the sand"
   ],
   "mood": "something breaking apart",
   "wav": "pilot/ep16/v14.wav",
   "d": 4.85,
   "e": "00zzwxsvyxxozvuwxm000zyzzyfypvxtzrl00000",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/2b80e3f0-3b06-5c9e-8799-fbb27313a18b/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/977bda22-cab8-5cee-b8fd-62f2648247c5.mp4",
     "in": 6.0,
     "dur": 11.81,
     "src": "Robinson Crusoe A",
     "y": 1927,
     "q": "a man lying face down in the sand",
     "fit": 0.34
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "THE PODCASTER",
   "text": "—monetization! I was gonna say pro-monetization!",
   "wav": "pilot/ep16/v15.wav",
   "d": 4.05,
   "e": "00nzzuvrxthd50rtpbzwprn2vxvsbnqne6000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "THE SHEPHERD",
   "text": "Is profit a form of prayer?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep16/v16.wav",
   "d": 2.5,
   "e": "000pzqi0bwvxebrk09qb6qwzwxs01tzvzrf80000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "With one snip of his pen, the Regent edits him free.",
   "see": [
    {
     "place": "p0b"
    },
    "a man helping another man up from the ground"
   ],
   "mood": "quiet calm",
   "wav": "pilot/ep16/v17.wav",
   "d": 4.25,
   "e": "00xyzyvqvvuxkywti00zzwvwknxttxkwvnd00000",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/38188482-86c9-58dc-85ec-de40b0621a94/v5-windowed-clip-split-1/clips/ba3715b2-4a85-5dfc-a105-b880b46b0769.mp4",
     "in": 47.0,
     "src": "Of Ice and Fire: The Mono Basin",
     "y": 1992,
     "q": "p0b"
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/evolution-of-the-oil-industry-the/clips/0001013180-0001017250.mp4",
     "in": 1.5,
     "dur": 4.07,
     "src": "EVOLUTION OF THE OIL INDUSTRY, THE",
     "y": 1934,
     "q": "a man helping another man up from the ground",
     "fit": 0.376
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "THE PODCASTER",
   "text": "Thanks. I hate you.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep16/v18.wav",
   "d": 1.875,
   "e": "000000zzzzppntxvojnwvp0ajlifeb4000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "THE REGENT",
   "text": "You’re welcome. It’s required.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep16/v19.wav",
   "d": 2.6,
   "e": "0000pzzuzyvoutrevvlkxpmwxxwrnjhb20000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "THE SHEPHERD",
   "text": "Do we escape by silence?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep16/v20.wav",
   "d": 2.275,
   "e": "0000szustznii0uvwm000nzynjfzyzwsng560000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "THE REGENT",
   "text": "The storm isn’t hunting you. It’s hunting assertions.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep16/v21.wav",
   "d": 3.925,
   "e": "008xmyzzswxpzwuusn0tsqzrwsmxzrroje000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "THE PODCASTER",
   "text": "So… no opinions.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep16/v22.wav",
   "d": 2.15,
   "e": "00008lzzztuwxyxusd0dqttpida7dd4000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "THE REGENT",
   "text": "No advocacy. No slogans. No “should.” Only questions, definitions, and administrative language.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep16/v23.wav",
   "d": 6.475,
   "e": "0mzwrruwtxwngzrw90zuunvstxqpswvmryrg8000"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "keep your head down and fill in the forms",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/983ce97f-aab9-5baf-8193-d32c26a836f6/v5-windowed-clip-split-1/clips/46f94749-a383-5b67-bc19-7e700e518b56.mp4",
   "in": 1.2,
   "d": 5.07,
   "said": "Oh, say hello when the chief clerk answers and then say, we'll say whatever you please.",
   "src": "Far Speaking",
   "y": 1935
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "THE REGENT",
   "text": "If you carry a form, the storm assumes you belong to it.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep16/v25.wav",
   "d": 4.125,
   "e": "00hyxqzyscxzsk0ppxyunjzxqtswywmwnb500000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "THE PODCASTER",
   "text": "Finally. A religion I understand.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep16/v26.wav",
   "d": 2.975,
   "e": "0000zzzxsm0nptqvvlqmfpkpmjoioh8200000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "Carrying their forms, they walk the desert road to shelter: a diner half-buried in sand. In its basement, a projector plays an old oil commercial on a loop.",
   "see": [
